{
  "info": {
    "name": "Quark Holder - API",
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
    "description": "Holder multi-tenant (QuarkID 2.0).\n\n**Flujo DIDComm principal (igual que wallet):**\n1. Issuer: `POST .../didcomm/offer` → copiar `invitation` (short URL `/oob/:id`)\n2. Holder: `POST .../didcomm/receive-invitation`\n3. Auto: conexión + accept offer + store VC (listeners)\n4. `GET .../records?type=W3cCredentialRecord`\n\nConvención (`setGlobalPrefix('v1')` + `@Controller`):\n- Admin: `/v1/holders`, `/v1/holders/:id/records/*`, OID4VC\n- `/v1/holders/:id/didcomm/receive-invitation` — único endpoint DIDComm",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "holderBaseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:9005" },
    { "key": "holderId", "value": "holder-wallet" },
    { "key": "invitationUrl", "value": "" },
    { "key": "offerUri", "value": "" },
    { "key": "requestUri", "value": "" },
    { "key": "lastDecodedCredentials", "value": "" },
    { "key": "recordType", "value": "W3cCredentialRecord" },
    { "key": "recordId", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 - Admin",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /v1/holders (listar disponibles)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{holderBaseUrl}}/v1/holders"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Listado holders', () => pm.expect(res.holders).to.be.an('array'));",
                  "if (res.holders?.length) {",
                  "  const first = res.holders[0];",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('holderId', first.holderId);",
                  "  if (first.did) pm.collectionVariables.set('holderDid', first.did);",
                  "  console.log(JSON.stringify(res.holders, null, 2));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /v1/holders (crear tenant)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"holderId\": \"{{holderId}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{holderBaseUrl}}/v1/holders",
            "description": "Crea tenant + DidRecord (did:key) + StorageVersionRecord."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.holderId) pm.collectionVariables.set('holderId', res.holderId);",
                  "if (res.did) {",
                  "  try { pm.environment.set('holderDid', res.did); } catch (e) {}",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('Holder creado', () => pm.expect(res.holderId).to.be.a('string'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "01 - DIDComm ({{holderId}})",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. POST receive-invitation (invitar+offer del issuer)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"invitationUrl\": \"{{invitationUrl}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{holderBaseUrl}}/v1/holders/{{holderId}}/didcomm/receive-invitation",
            "description": "**Flujo principal (como wallet).** Pegá `invitation` de Issuer `POST .../didcomm/offer`. Luego `GET .../records?type=W3cCredentialRecord`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2. GET records W3cCredentialRecord (tras auto-offer)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{holderBaseUrl}}/v1/holders/{{holderId}}/records?type=W3cCredentialRecord"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET records ConnectionRecord",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{holderBaseUrl}}/v1/holders/{{holderId}}/records?type=ConnectionRecord"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "02 - OID4VCI / OID4VP ({{holderId}})",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /v1/holders/{{holderId}}/openid4vc/receive-offer",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"offerUri\": \"{{offerUri}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{holderBaseUrl}}/v1/holders/{{holderId}}/openid4vc/receive-offer"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /v1/holders/{{holderId}}/openid4vc/present",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"requestUri\": \"{{requestUri}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{holderBaseUrl}}/v1/holders/{{holderId}}/openid4vc/present"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "03 - Records ({{holderId}})",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /{{holderId}}/records/types",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{holderBaseUrl}}/v1/holders/{{holderId}}/records/types"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /{{holderId}}/records?type=W3cCredentialRecord",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{holderBaseUrl}}/v1/holders/{{holderId}}/records?type=W3cCredentialRecord&page=1&limit=20",
              "host": ["{{holderBaseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["{{holderId}}", "records"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "type", "value": "W3cCredentialRecord" },
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "20" }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /{{holderId}}/records/:recordType/:recordId",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{holderBaseUrl}}/v1/holders/{{holderId}}/records/{{recordType}}/{{recordId}}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "04 - Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /v1/health",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{holderBaseUrl}}/v1/health"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /v1/health/ready",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{holderBaseUrl}}/v1/health/ready",
            "description": "Readiness: agent Credo inicializado. 503 si el bootstrap aún no terminó."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('ready true', () => pm.expect(res.ready).to.be.true);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
